      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM (1) has missed the frame at her last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in her excellent 22.13 win at this track over 390m. Expected to push the clock again here. RANSOM (7) was never in contention last time after drifting back at Bendigo, but prior to that won easily by 8 lengths at Bendigo (24.13) beating Devon Ruslie in a Bottom Up - Grade 7 on October 10. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Can figure in the finish. MR. BOJANGLES (3) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a 4.5 lengths third (22.48) in a Mix 6/7. Should be in this for a long way. CHAPPY'S HIKARI (4) is worth consideration.",
